s/d22be5aff81c8b672d88e68a133125ca.poster.avif?t=1754880166\" width=640 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716940/extras/d22be5aff81c8b672d88e68a133125ca.webm?t=1754880166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716940/extras/d22be5aff81c8b672d88e68a133125ca.mp4?t=1754880166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
